---
import groupA from '../assets/decor/group-a.svg';
import groupB from '../assets/decor/group-b.svg';
import ficoAccentBr from '../assets/decor/fico-accent-br.svg';
import ficoTlBottom from '../assets/decor/fico-tl-bottom.svg';
---

<section class="gifts" id="regali">
	<img class="decor decor-tl-a" src={groupA.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
	<img class="decor decor-tl-b" src={groupB.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
	<img class="decor decor-br" src={ficoAccentBr.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
	<img class="decor decor-bl" src={ficoTlBottom.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true" />

	<div class="connector">
		<span class="line"></span>
		<span class="dot">03</span>
	</div>

	<p class="eyebrow">ULTIMA TAPPA</p>
	<h2>Una nuova vita che comincia...</h2>
	<p class="intro">
		La vostra presenza è per noi il regalo più bello, per questo ci teniamo a festeggiare con ciascuno di voi e a condividere la nostra gioia. Nulla supera la gratitudine di esservi amici e di aver condiviso con voi parte dei nostri cammini. Il nostro <i>sì</i> è sostenuto da voi.
	</p>
	<p class="intro">P.S. Siccome Carlo è proprio un tipo veniale... ci teneva a lasciarvi almeno un IBAN, nella speranza che vi venga voglia di farci un regalino.
	</p>
	<div class="options">
		<div class="option">
			<p class="label">LISTA NOZZE</p>
			<p class="name">La Vetrinetta</p>
			<p class="detail">
				Per chi vuole costruire insieme a noi la nostra casa. La lista è aperta presso il
				negozio: chiamate per scoprire le idee regalo che abbiamo scelto.
			</p>
			<a class="cta" href="tel:+390498700975">Chiama 049 870 0975</a>
		</div>
		<div class="option">
			<p class="label">BONIFICO</p>
			<p class="detail">Per chi preferisce regalarci avventure e lunghi viaggi.</p>
			<div class="iban">
				<p id="iban-value">IT41D0357601601010002753961</p>
				<button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy-target="iban-value" aria-label="Copia IBAN">
					<svg class="icon-copy" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
						<rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"></rect>
						<path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path>
					</svg>
					<svg class="icon-check" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
						<polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
					</svg>
				</button>
			</div>
			<p class="detail">Intestato a: Rita Andreuzza</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.gifts {
		position: relative;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 28px);
		background: var(--color-cream);
		overflow: clip;
		padding: 0 clamp(24px, 6vw, 80px) clamp(72px, 10vw, 120px);
	}

	.connector {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.line {
		background: var(--color-purple);
		width: 4px;
		height: 56px;
	}

	.dot {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 64px;
		height: 64px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: #fff;
		border: 3px solid var(--color-purple);
		color: var(--color-purple);
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 20px;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		color: var(--color-orange-dark);
		font-size: 14px;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
	}

	h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--color-purple);
		text-align: center;
		font-size: clamp(30px, 4.5vw, 52px);
	}

	.intro {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		color: #4d4059;
		font-size: 17px;
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 60ch;
	}

	.options {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 28px;
		justify-content: center;
		padding-top: 8px;
	}

	.option {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 12px;
		width: 340px;
		max-width: 100%;
		padding: 32px;
		border-radius: 24px;
		background: #fff;
	}

	.label {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-orange-dark);
		font-size: 14px;
		letter-spacing: 1.5px;
	}

	.name {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-purple);
		font-size: 18px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.detail {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		color: var(--color-body-on-white);
		font-size: 14px;
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 34ch;
	}

	.cta {
		margin-top: 4px;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 14px;
		color: var(--color-cream);
		text-decoration: none;
		background: var(--color-orange-dark);
		padding: 10px 22px;
		border-radius: 999px;
	}

	.iban {
		width: 100%;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 10px;
		background: var(--color-cream);
		border-radius: 14px;
		padding: 16px 20px;
	}

	.iban p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--color-purple);
		font-size: 15px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.copy-btn {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 30px;
		height: 30px;
		padding: 0;
		border: none;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: transparent;
		color: var(--color-purple);
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
	}

	.copy-btn:hover,
	.copy-btn:focus-visible {
		background: var(--color-purple);
		color: var(--color-cream);
	}

	.copy-btn .icon-check {
		display: none;
	}

	.copy-btn.copied .icon-copy {
		display: none;
	}

	.copy-btn.copied .icon-check {
		display: block;
	}

	.copy-btn.copied {
		background: var(--color-purple);
		color: var(--color-cream);
	}

	.thanks {
		margin: 8px 0 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		color: var(--color-orange-dark);
		font-size: 15px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.decor {
		position: absolute;
		pointer-events: none;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}

	.decor-tl-a,
	.decor-tl-b {
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 70px;
	}

	.decor-br {
		bottom: 40px;
		right: 20px;
		width: clamp(90px, 10vw, 130px);
	}

	.decor-bl {
		bottom: -40px;
		left: -50px;
		width: clamp(140px, 15vw, 200px);
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.decor {
			display: none;
		}
	}
</style>

<script>
	document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.copy-btn').forEach((button) => {
		const targetId = button.dataset.copyTarget;
		const target = targetId ? document.getElementById(targetId) : null;
		if (!target) return;

		button.addEventListener('click', async () => {
			try {
				await navigator.clipboard.writeText(target.textContent?.trim() ?? '');
			} catch {
				return;
			}
			button.classList.add('copied');
			button.setAttribute('aria-label', 'IBAN copiato');
			window.clearTimeout(Number(button.dataset.copyTimeout));
			const timeout = window.setTimeout(() => {
				button.classList.remove('copied');
				button.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Copia IBAN');
			}, 2000);
			button.dataset.copyTimeout = String(timeout);
		});
	});
</script>
